.TH QUIPU-UNRAVEL 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-unravel \- Show facts as they were at a transaction or valid time
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu unravel\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-tx\fR] [\fB\-\-valid\-at\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show facts as they were at a transaction or valid time
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-tx\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-valid\-at\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
